            <ArticleTitle>Perioperative care of the elderly patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S106-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Perioperative management is typically more complicated in older patients than in younger patients and requires more assessment and evaluation before surgery as well as precautionary steps after surgery to manage these high-risk patients.</AbstractText>
